{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on a soothing yet thrilling journey among the stars with <strong>Cozy Space Shooter</strong>\u2014a retro-inspired 2D arcade game that blends fast-paced shooting action with a warm, inviting atmosphere. Pilot your spacecraft through vibrant cosmic vistas, weave between asteroid fields, and defend peaceful colonies from waves of quirky alien invaders.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Cozy Aesthetic</strong><br>Hand-drawn pixel art, pastel color palettes, and a chill lo-fi soundtrack set the perfect mood for both short bursts and marathon sessions.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Why You\u2019ll Love It</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you have five minutes or five hours, Cozy Space Shooter delivers a bite-sized yet deeply satisfying experience. The perfect mix of adrenaline and relaxation, it\u2019s your go-to escape when you want to press \u201cplay\u201d and drift among the galaxies.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3756850?t=1747883682","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3756850?t=1747883682","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756850/42b0d8bfa24c58e1e2927f661e9b658f1903c729/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747883682","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756850/42b0d8bfa24c58e1e2927f661e9b658f1903c729/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747883682","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on a soothing yet thrilling journey among the stars with <strong>Cozy Space Shooter</strong>\u2014a retro-inspired 2D arcade game that blends fast-paced shooting action with a warm, inviting atmosphere. Pilot your spacecraft through vibrant cosmic vistas, weave between asteroid fields, and defend peaceful colonies from waves of quirky alien invaders.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Cozy Aesthetic</strong><br>Hand-drawn pixel art, pastel color palettes, and a chill lo-fi soundtrack set the perfect mood for both short bursts and marathon sessions.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Why You\u2019ll Love It</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you have five minutes or five hours, Cozy Space Shooter delivers a bite-sized yet deeply satisfying experience. The perfect mix of adrenaline and relaxation, it\u2019s your go-to escape when you want to press \u201cplay\u201d and drift among the galaxies.</p>","developers":["me"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756850/5d8867bedcbc612abad7bc5ca1c27267b83350f5/header.jpg?t=1747883682","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257141944,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257141944/movie480.mp4?t=1747883679","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257141944/movie_max.mp4?t=1747883679"},"name":"Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257141944/560dc319d96738cccd04fda63661ca6564b4cb4e/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1747883679","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257141944/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1747883679","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257141944/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1747883679"}}],"name":"Cozy Space Shooter","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> win7/win10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> intel Core i7 4770<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 100 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 970<br